 168:../src/middleware/bacnet/demo/handler/h_rpm.c **** /** Handler for a ReadPropertyMultiple Service request.
 169:../src/middleware/bacnet/demo/handler/h_rpm.c ****  * @ingroup DSRPM
 170:../src/middleware/bacnet/demo/handler/h_rpm.c ****  * This handler will be invoked by apdu_handler() if it has been enabled
 171:../src/middleware/bacnet/demo/handler/h_rpm.c ****  * by a call to apdu_set_confirmed_handler().
 172:../src/middleware/bacnet/demo/handler/h_rpm.c ****  * This handler builds a response packet, which is
 173:../src/middleware/bacnet/demo/handler/h_rpm.c ****  * - an Abort if
 174:../src/middleware/bacnet/demo/handler/h_rpm.c ****  *   - the message is segmented
 175:../src/middleware/bacnet/demo/handler/h_rpm.c ****  *   - if decoding fails
 176:../src/middleware/bacnet/demo/handler/h_rpm.c ****  *   - if the response would be too large
 177:../src/middleware/bacnet/demo/handler/h_rpm.c ****  * - the result from each included read request, if it succeeds
 178:../src/middleware/bacnet/demo/handler/h_rpm.c ****  * - an Error if processing fails for all, or individual errors if only some fail,
 179:../src/middleware/bacnet/demo/handler/h_rpm.c ****  *   or there isn't enough room in the APDU to fit the data.
 180:../src/middleware/bacnet/demo/handler/h_rpm.c ****  *
 181:../src/middleware/bacnet/demo/handler/h_rpm.c ****  * @param service_request [in] The contents of the service request.
 182:../src/middleware/bacnet/demo/handler/h_rpm.c ****  * @param service_len [in] The length of the service_request.
 183:../src/middleware/bacnet/demo/handler/h_rpm.c ****  * @param src [in] BACNET_ADDRESS of the source of the message
 184:../src/middleware/bacnet/demo/handler/h_rpm.c ****  * @param service_data [in] The BACNET_CONFIRMED_SERVICE_DATA information
 185:../src/middleware/bacnet/demo/handler/h_rpm.c ****  *                          decoded from the APDU header of this message.
 186:../src/middleware/bacnet/demo/handler/h_rpm.c ****  */
